            "review_title": "Review at Banh Mi Trang",
            "review_text": "Marco M\nGothenburg, Sweden413 contributions\n1\nHidden simple and qualitative place\nFeb 2020 • Couples\nWe found this place in a small side street away from the noise. We had a simple lunch there, with fresh juice and vietnamese baguette. Both were excellent, very fresh, tasty - quality, no doubt. \nThe setting is simple yet tidy and clean. Two young boys work there, they work with care and help you very politely. \nTherefore we decided to list the place, it is also close to many hotels and hostels, can be good for lunch or anytime during the day - I believe they close in the early evening.\nI give them a 5 because it was good quality for the price, on the lower edge compared to the average here in Nha Trang.\nRead more\nWritten February 12, 2020",
